{"parse": {"title": "AR-1", "pageid": 89271, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/AR-0\" title=\"AR-0\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">AR-1</span><a href=\"/wiki/AR-2\" title=\"AR-2\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">AR</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">1</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.84.BF.E7.AB.A5.E6.B8.B8.E6.88.8F\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"儿童游戏\">儿童游戏</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 儿童游戏</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">A Children's Game</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_haitan_zhou\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6f/Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_haitan_zhou.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>研究室的灯泡该换了，演算用的纸张或许也该多备一些……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>上次37还提出过，需要……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>哦，苏菲亚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>你走得这么急，又有要忙的事儿吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>算不上忙，只是去研究室看看37的进展。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>37……说起来也有好一阵子没见到她在这片沙滩出现了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅰ：</div><div>大概要演算那些留下的资料吧？毕竟其他人也没法接手……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每当提及“流溢”，气氛总会稍显沉重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>喊住苏菲亚的女性面露关切，试图将对话唤回寻常的道路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>别太担心，37会找到结果的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教众Ⅱ：</div><div>你们也要多注意些身体，别把自己累坏了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>好的，非常感谢两位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她伸出手，在身前描绘着象征祝愿的图案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>交换过彼此的关心，是时候继续迈开脚步。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/59/Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_dongxueyanjiushi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>爬满凌乱笔迹的草稿纸，堆放在各处的厚重书籍，魔精掉落的毛发……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>仿佛有一群阿其翁曾光顾此地，或是这间研究室已在洋流中无休止地打转了数百年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>任谁见到这副景象，都会由衷地感到疲惫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而研究室的主人正趴在桌前，安心地沉入美梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>唉，37。你就从没想过试着自己打扫房间吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她放轻动作，跨过地面的书本小山，逐步靠近那张长桌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>放在37手边的笔记本看上去格外眼熟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾经的使用者十分珍惜这本笔记，其中的图画与注解工整清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>翻过一页，两页，数十页，是一行行数据校验记录，伴以少量工程绘图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又翻过几页，内容开始与这座岛屿上的事物相关，偶尔混有乐谱与简单的涂画，记录着飞过的海鸥和一个小姑娘玩耍的身影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，手指停在了绘有方格，写着几道题目的纸页之上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>唔……苏菲亚？你来啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37揉了揉眼睛，目光很快转向了好友手里的笔记本。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>噢，我刚才找东西的时候发现了这个小本子！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>休在里面写了很多有趣的内容，我想看看有没有和“流溢”相关的记录。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37直起身，仔细打量着苏菲亚正在阅览的一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我记得这一页……那时候我还很小，踮着脚才能够到父亲的桌面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>我告诉他，我的朋友对一切游戏似乎都不感兴趣，而我又对数学犯愁……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-508301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>父亲就拿来矮凳，让我站得足够高，能看见他在笔记本上写下的字迹……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508314.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-508314.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508314.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508314.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-508314.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508314.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/63/HeadIconSmall-508314.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508314.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……抱歉，这并不是什么重要的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她合上笔记，转而望向一旁的37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>里面都是为孩子设计的题目，对你来说确实太过简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>不必把时间花在这些不重要的地方，大家还等着你公布下一阶段的研究成果呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>这本笔记我会带走收好的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>不不，苏菲亚！它们并不只是给小孩子的问题——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>我刚才发现题目的答案是一组有趣的数列！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它们很可能与天体音律有关系，这不是休常常关注的知识吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>你瞧，这个数与下一个数之间似乎符合八度音阶的规律……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>旁边标注的符号也非常特殊！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>它们都与3有关系，这一定是用三角形组合成的小把戏！我已经尝试了好几种解法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>37认真地一项项列举出她所发现的“有趣的内容”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她滔滔不绝，专注而热情，且因此闪闪发亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>正如过去在海滩上的讲述，以及此后无数个日夜对“流溢”的研究。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>抱持着强烈的好奇心，对凡事都要瞧个究竟。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——一如既往，从不变改。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……好吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>既然这样，我会帮助你找出答案的，37。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>但我们要抓紧时间，之后你就会把精力放回到主要的研究上来，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>当然！我很确定这要不了多久！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">37：</div><div>首先我们得先找个够宽敞的地方，就像笔记本里写的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笔记本在37的手中翻得哗哗作响。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她边从书页里捕捉着那点闪烁不定的灵感，边走向研究室的出口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>唉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>希望这的确要不了多久……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏菲亚：</div><div>……我这样任由她浪费时间，真的好吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "AR-1"}}